@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title State diagram — Idea status

[*] --> Logged : Capture idea
Logged --> Critiquing : Notes saved (automatic)
Logged --> Curating : Curated (automatic)
Critiquing --> Curating : Curated (automatic)
Logged --> Building : Owner sets Building
Critiquing --> Building : Owner sets Building
Curating --> Building : Owner sets Building
Building --> Built : Owner sets Built
Curating --> Built : Owner sets Built
@enduml
